        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6c6609ec-4c3c-4e44-82f7-206bffc25e23\",\"review_text\":\"Ta difícil essa playlist aleatória que fica repetindo a mesma playlist sempre, se for pra ser assim, melhor escutar minha playlist em ordem.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ad4e7266-1849-4117-83c0-de0128d1f36f\",\"review_text\":\"Im tired of sign in every week, the app get lo off without reason.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8b3916d2-f37d-459a-a96b-e4ab786cb722\",\"review_text\":\"Subscription nhi loge to.... 3/4 months baad song play or change nhi hoga.... 1 days baad song change karne milega 👍🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"351742eb-7e75-4b3b-bc80-84b23bdcde7f\",\"review_text\":\"Saim\"},{\"review_id\":\"a5c779a3-c7ca-493f-8496-31bf65108d48\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing 💓\"},{\"review_id\":\"46192623-e763-4187-92d8-d416ae13ee56\",\"review_text\":\"Terrible service\"},{\"review_id\":\"463770a6-9ad6-4633-b0ef-55072ddd12c0\",\"review_text\":\"Merge\"},{\"review_id\":\"0cd65c65-3929-44fc-ae00-ac4927b85a5c\",\"review_text\":\"It's ok but it's getting expensive and it is literally useless if you do not have a high speed internet connection. It's better to put it on airplane mode than dare drop below perfect signal\"},{\"review_id\":\"f960902a-8edf-4cac-bbe5-cb0d69b705ab\",\"review_text\":\"Name a better music app\"},{\"review_id\":\"62253c45-1eb7-4a31-9012-c50acfaaeaa4\",\"review_text\":\"Jesus, this app became horrible. I feel like you're just trying to capitalize off this app, but removing features just makes it frustrating to use this app at all and people are gonna uninstall your app. Just return it to how it was before, it's honestly so annoying that I can't even view the songs in the playlist or play them when I want!\"}]}"
